Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 12:16:13 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] Do not iterate a NULL InputSources; release +unity3 (LP:
 #2166139)

AccountsService returns NULL for a user's input sources while it has
nothing cached, for instance while accounts-daemon restarts. The greeter's
service then iterated NULL in migrate_input_sources() and crashed in
g_variant_iter_new(). Reading the xkb layouts moves to one function that
treats NULL as no layouts, with a test; a NULL user name is not passed to
LightDM either.

Assisted-by: LLM claude-opus-5-5
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
